  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fbetterdogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/c93b172f-e281-4d3c-823a-400a3f2c4287.png\" width=\"900\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-dogs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/PCPWmK2.png\" width=\"113\" height=\"113\"></a> &nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/F4W91ag.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"255\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>使用前請閱讀<br>此資源包適用於 Minecraft 1.21.6 及以下版本，最低支援至 1.8.9。</strong><strong><br></strong>此資源包需要&nbsp;<strong>Optifine (Forge)</strong>&nbsp;或 EMF + ETF（同時支援 Forge 與 Fabric）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kLNX8G9.png\" width=\"836\" height=\"468\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>所有品種的遊戲內截圖：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/better-cats-minecraft/screenshots\" rel=\"nofollow\">點擊這裡</a></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JPkPOYZ.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"115\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zGjFJFo.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"576\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uGu910J.png\" width=\"837\" height=\"76\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 由於某些原因，原先展示此效果的 GIF 連結已過期，但實際上的動畫效果更加逼真。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">我是以興趣為前提進行製作，但非常感謝各位的真誠捐贈！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fmrblueyetimc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1192828/description_cd73d6ea-5748-4aa7-9037-23e12d5be3c4.webp\" width=\"171\" height=\"43\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
